  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Hookfall.UI.MainMenuUI
  introLines:
  - Long ago, a kingdom raised a fortress around the Heartstone, a relic strong enough
    to bend gravity.
  - When the fortress fell, the land broke apart, but the pieces never fell. The
    Heartstone holds them above an endless abyss.
  - You are a Warden of the Order of the Tether. Guard the Heartstone for as long
    as you can.
  credits: 'Hookfall

    A solo project by Esad Yesilyurt

    Game Studio: AI in
    Game Development, Istanbul Kent University


    Made with Unity 6 (URP, Shader
    Graph, Cinemachine) and Blender.

    Code, models and writing assisted by Claude
    (Anthropic); see Docs/PromptLog.md.


    Sound and music: licensed files listed
    in Docs/Credits.md.'
